{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "12a4e8a6-f28d-806a-9bd3-a038cc6a6a53",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T15:39:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lidia Brito",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:37:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:37:27-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Um, my name is Lidia Brito. I'm calling because the trash truck broke my bin this morning, you know, the big rolling one? The lid is cracked right off the hinge and one of the wheels is just gone. Right, so, I mean, it's not usable now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:37:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Sorry about that. Was it the trash bin or the recycling bin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:37:48-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The trash one. The green, um, well, the dark green one. I found it tipped over at the curb after they went by, and I mean, it was fine last week. Does that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:38:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It does. Those lifts can be rough on the older ones. So you want a replacement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:38:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, right. How do I request one? Is that something I do through you, or is it a different office, or what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:38:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take it right here. I just need your name, which I have, the address where the bin goes, and a phone number in case the crew needs to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:38:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the number is 401-555-0159. And, um, the address, I mean, do you need it right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:38:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I do, it's how the crew finds the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:38:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sure, sure. I'm sorry, give me one second. [pause] Mom, not yet, five more minutes. Sorry, that's my daughter. She keeps asking if it's time to go yet. We have an appointment, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:38:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, take your time. I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:38:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Yeah, so, I mean, I don't want to give the address and have it go in wrong. Could I maybe call back with it? Or is there another way, like you note it and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:39:03-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, if you'd rather. Just call back when you have a minute and give us the address and a note that the truck damaged it. Once it's logged, the crew will bring a new one, usually within a week or so. Leave the broken one at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:39:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so leave the broken one out, and they swap it. Right? I'm following you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. They take the damaged one and drop off the new one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:39:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great. And do I need to do anything about the lid, like, take a picture or whatever?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:39:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A picture isn't required, but it doesn't hurt to keep one. Just tell us it was damaged by the truck on today's pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:39:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Mom, I said five minutes! Sorry. Okay, I think that's everything. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:39:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
